bot First Glyph
modes 2d 3d

: target
  "TRACK" status-text!
  range status-value!
  bearing dup aim! scan-heading!
  elevation dup aim-pitch! scan-pitch!
  cooldown 0 = aim-error abs 3 < and
  energy fire-base fire-per-power + 5 + >= and fire!
;

: roam
  "SEARCH" status-text!
  tick status-value!
  0.7 drive!
  0.25 turn!
  heading tick 8 * + scan-heading!
  mode3 if tick 30 / sin 22 * scan-pitch! then
  58 scan-arc!
;

# A cue says roughly where a robot is: head that way and sweep across it.
: listen
  cue-bearing heading angle 45 / clamp1 turn!
  cue-bearing tick 30 * sin cue-error 10 + * + scan-heading!
  30 scan-arc!
;

# Leave the storm straight away from its centre; this replaces the steering above.
: flee
  1 drive!
  storm-bearing 180 + heading angle 30 / clamp1 turn!
;

contact if target else roam cue-present if listen then then
storm-distance 80 < if flee then
